      },
      "message": "fix(rest): sign a cached path in the lattice form the file stores\n\npath_sig hashed every move float bit-exact, while the project file\nwrites moves through the 1 um lattice snap. A generated path off the\nlattice (threading's y = 6.050000000000001) then signed differently\nafter save and load (6.05), so a dependent op's rest digest no longer\nmatched and the second op of a chain reopened Stale. Hash each float\nsnapped to the lattice instead: on-lattice paths sign exactly as\nbefore, a change of half a micron or more still moves the signature.\n\nPinned by turning_thread::a_chain_of_threading_ops_stays_ok_through_save_and_load.\n\nFixes #1351\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
